---
/**
 * Production Experience section (PRD 5.5).
 *
 * Surfaces the claim that the candidate has worked on real professional
 * systems, separate from the portfolio demos. Until verified facts exist,
 * the section is a placeholder honesty card explaining what will go here
 * and why nothing is published yet.
 */
---

<section class="production container" aria-labelledby="production-title" data-state="pending-facts">
  <p class="label production__eyebrow">Production Experience</p>
  <h2 id="production-title">Real professional work, separate from the demos.</h2>
  <p class="production__lead">
    Beyond the portfolio projects above, this section is reserved for documented experience shipping
    and maintaining production systems in a professional setting.
  </p>

  <p class="production__lead">
    Two entries are published so far. The first is
    <a href="/work/production-saas-platform/" class="production__inline-link"
      >Production SaaS Platform: GuruInovatif (Aug 2022 – Jan 2024)</a
    >
    — full-stack work on source-tracking, an events feature, an affiliate programme, and the public landing
    page. The second is
    <a href="/work/object-expression-sdn-bhd/" class="production__inline-link"
      >Object Expression Sdn. Bhd. (Jan 2024 – Mar 2025)</a
    >
    — full-time Fullstack Developer role at a Cyberjaya-based Malaysian software company, working on PHP
    and Laravel web application features. Both entries are bounded by the same honesty rules: specific
    retention/conversion/performance impact is left as pending evidence rather than rounded up; the confidentiality
    boundary (PRD 10.2) applies to every contribution.
  </p>

  <aside class="production__notice" role="status">
    <p class="label production__notice-label">Honesty notice</p>
    <p class="production__notice-body">
      <strong>Production claims are bounded by evidence.</strong>
      The first entry below is published with generic descriptions and explicit "pending evidence" markers
      wherever a metric is not isolated to this contribution. Per PRD 10.2, no confidential code, credentials,
      customer data, proprietary architecture, or internal business information appears here. Per the
      project's honesty rules, anything unverified is marked pending rather than removed silently.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <dl class="production__facets">
    <div class="production__facet">
      <dt class="label">What's intended for this section</dt>
      <dd>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>Context — what kind of production product it was.</li>
          <li>Role — the actual scope, bounded accurately.</li>
          <li>Problems and contributions — generic patterns, employer-neutral.</li>
          <li>Outcome — measurable results <em>only</em> when real data exists.</li>
        </ul>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="production__facet">
      <dt class="label">What will never appear here without verification</dt>
      <dd>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>Confidential client code or credentials.</li>
          <li>Sensitive customer or business data.</li>
          <li>Proprietary architecture details or internal processes.</li>
          <li>Metrics that are not personally attributable and sourceable.</li>
        </ul>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="production__facet">
      <dt class="label">Where the contributions are tracked</dt>
      <dd>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/codebyaria/production-case-study" rel="noopener"
              >production-case-study</a
            >
            — pending scaffold for the standalone case-study repo.
          </li>
          <li>
            <code>PENDING-FACTS.md</code> — per-contribution blocks awaiting evidence.
          </li>
          <li>
            <code>private-source.md</code> — full internal fact source, kept out of the public repo.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</section>

<style>
  .production {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .production__eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .production h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    max-width: 28ch;
  }
  .production__lead {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
    font-family: var(--font-longform);
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .production__lead + .production__lead {
    margin-top: calc(-1 * var(--space-sm));
  }
  .production__inline-link {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .production__inline-link:hover,
  .production__inline-link:focus-visible {
    border-bottom-color: transparent;
  }
  .production__notice {
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--caution);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .production__notice-label {
    color: var(--caution);
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .production__notice-body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .production__notice-body strong {
    color: var(--caution);
  }
  .production__notice-body code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    background: var(--paper);
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .production__facets {
    margin: var(--space-md) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));
  }
  .production__facet {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .production__facet dt {
    color: var(--soft-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .production__facet dd {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .production__facet ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  .production__facet li {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .production__facet li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.65em;
    width: 0.6rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .production__facet em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--soft-ink);
  }
  .production__facet a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  }
  .production__facet a:hover,
  .production__facet a:focus-visible {
    border-bottom-color: transparent;
  }
  .production__facet code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: var(--paper);
    padding: 0.1em 0.3em;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
</style>
